on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  5] extcall 17 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  7] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  8] jmpifz [ 25] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then / else
  [ 11] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 14] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [ 16] extcall 24 .............................. <marker(1)>
  [ 18] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(1)>
  [ 20] extcall 11 .............................. go(marker(1))
  [ 22] jmp [ 38]
  [ 25] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 26] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 28] extcall 24 .............................. <marker(0)>
  [ 30] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 33] add ..................................... <marker(0) + 1>
  [ 34] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0) + 1>
  [ 36] extcall 11 .............................. go(marker(0) + 1)
  [ 38] ret
end
